<tr><td style="padding:12px 28px 0;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:bold;color:#101828;">Act today: your free Fable week ends tomorrow at 1:29 PM IST</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:10px 28px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#27324A;">Pro users can use Fable 5.2 at no extra cost until 16 Nov 11:59 PM PT, which is Tue 17 Nov 1:29 PM IST. Your one free Fable limit reset expires at the same moment. After that, Fable on Pro is billed to usage credits.</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:14px 28px 0;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top" style="padding:0 8px 8px 0;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#F3F5F9" style="padding:8px 12px;background:#F3F5F9;"><div style="font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;color:#101828;line-height:1.2;">17 Nov, 1:29 PM</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:#5B6578;line-height:1.35;">IST: Fable offer and Fable reset end</div></td></tr></table></td><td valign="top" style="padding:0 8px 8px 0;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#F3F5F9" style="padding:8px 12px;background:#F3F5F9;"><div style="font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;color:#101828;line-height:1.2;">11 Dec, 3:30 AM</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:#5B6578;line-height:1.35;">IST: use-by for the free full reset (reported)</div></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px 28px 0;">
