<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
<td bgcolor="#F0F4FF" style="background:#F0F4FF;padding:12px 16px;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#27324A;">
<div style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:bold;color:#2E4BE0;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;">TRY IT IN 5 MINUTES</div>Claude, Settings, Usage, Limit resets, Reset for free. Use the Fable reset before tomorrow afternoon and keep the full reset (all models, announced 10 Nov) for a heavy week before 11 Dec.</td>
</tr></table></td></tr>
